{"3823300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rebloom", "steam_appid": 3823300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget swords and shields. In Rebloom, your only defence against the undead is a well-tended garden. In this action rogue-lite, you must reclaim a world lost to decay by planting, mutating, and cross-pollinating a lethal floral arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823300/extras/bf6d6f07415408c839718080a26382da.poster.avif?t=1772733776\" width=1080 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823300/extras/bf6d6f07415408c839718080a26382da.webm?t=1772733776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823300/extras/bf6d6f07415408c839718080a26382da.mp4?t=1772733776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Science of Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nature doesn’t just grow; it evolves. Every time you plant a seed, there is a chance for a <strong>Mutation</strong>. Position your flowers strategically to trigger <strong>Cross-Pollination</strong>, blending the traits of parent plants to create entirely new, more powerful species.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>125 Unique Flower Types:</strong> Blast hordes with massive area damage, ensnare the undead in slowing fields, and sprout lush grass to reclaim the land from encroaching decay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genetic Traits:</strong> New flowers inherit traits from their parents. Experiment with combinations to find the ultimate zombie-killing hybrid.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Upgrades:</strong> Enhance your garden by increasing range, widening coverage, or extending effect durations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823300/extras/712ec823f44d75afcbe7f503fdedb841.avif?t=1772733776\" width=1080 height=660 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tactical Gardening</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The zombies aren’t just mindless, they’re hungry. While you are the main course, they won’t hesitate to snack on your defences.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Stakes Appetites:</strong> When a zombie eats a flower, it might take massive damage or be slowed to a crawl... but some &quot;tasty&quot; flowers might accidentally heal the horde. Choose what you plant wisely!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Push Back the Decay:</strong> Use specialized floral powers to slow the undead and literally push back the creeping decay that threatens to swallow the islands.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Reclaim the Archipelago</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey takes you across <strong>10 unique zombie-infested islands</strong>. Each island presents a steeper challenge, culminating in a <strong>massive Boss fight</strong> that will test your botanical strategy to its limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823300/extras/529333c7508500fefb22093e84f6f793.poster.avif?t=1772733776\" width=1080 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823300/extras/529333c7508500fefb22093e84f6f793.webm?t=1772733776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823300/extras/529333c7508500fefb22093e84f6f793.mp4?t=1772733776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless Bloom</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you’ve mastered the garden? Surviving all 10 islands is just the beginning. Unlock <strong>Extra Infection Levels</strong> to push your skills and your mutations to the absolute limit in a high difficulty endgame challenge.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget swords and shields. In Rebloom, your only defence against the undead is a well-tended garden. In this action rogue-lite, you must reclaim a world lost to decay by planting, mutating, and cross-pollinating a lethal floral arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823300/extras/bf6d6f07415408c839718080a26382da.poster.avif?t=1772733776\" width=1080 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823300/extras/bf6d6f07415408c839718080a26382da.webm?t=1772733776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823300/extras/bf6d6f07415408c839718080a26382da.mp4?t=1772733776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Science of Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nature doesn’t just grow; it evolves. Every time you plant a seed, there is a chance for a <strong>Mutation</strong>. Position your flowers strategically to trigger <strong>Cross-Pollination</strong>, blending the traits of parent plants to create entirely new, more powerful species.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>125 Unique Flower Types:</strong> Blast hordes with massive area damage, ensnare the undead in slowing fields, and sprout lush grass to reclaim the land from encroaching decay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genetic Traits:</strong> New flowers inherit traits from their parents. Experiment with combinations to find the ultimate zombie-killing hybrid.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Upgrades:</strong> Enhance your garden by increasing range, widening coverage, or extending effect durations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823300/extras/712ec823f44d75afcbe7f503fdedb841.avif?t=1772733776\" width=1080 height=660 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tactical Gardening</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The zombies aren’t just mindless, they’re hungry. While you are the main course, they won’t hesitate to snack on your defences.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Stakes Appetites:</strong> When a zombie eats a flower, it might take massive damage or be slowed to a crawl... but some &quot;tasty&quot; flowers might accidentally heal the horde. Choose what you plant wisely!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Push Back the Decay:</strong> Use specialized floral powers to slow the undead and literally push back the creeping decay that threatens to swallow the islands.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Reclaim the Archipelago</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey takes you across <strong>10 unique zombie-infested islands</strong>. Each island presents a steeper challenge, culminating in a <strong>massive Boss fight</strong> that will test your botanical strategy to its limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823300/extras/529333c7508500fefb22093e84f6f793.poster.avif?t=1772733776\" width=1080 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823300/extras/529333c7508500fefb22093e84f6f793.webm?t=1772733776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823300/extras/529333c7508500fefb22093e84f6f793.mp4?t=1772733776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless Bloom</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you’ve mastered the garden? Surviving all 10 islands is just the beginning. Unlock <strong>Extra Infection Levels</strong> to push your skills and your mutations to the absolute limit in a high difficulty endgame challenge.</p>", "short_description": "Ditch the swords for petals! Rebloom is a floral action rogue-lite where you fight zombies with mutant plants. Use cross-pollination to discover 125 unique flower types, each with powerful abilities. Plant, pick, and survive to reclaim a post-apocalyptic world!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Bulgarian, Czech, Danish, Dutch, Finnish, Greek, Hungarian, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Swedish, Thai, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823300/4228933954ada0c71da6d131dc337e54c8f9cbd8/header.jpg?t=1772733776", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823300/f8f0d3166aea505284733292d690b965408a7233/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772733776", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823300/f8f0d3166aea505284733292d690b965408a7233/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772733776", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 version 21H1 (build 19043) or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x86, x64 architecture with SSE2 instruction set support, Arm64<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li>